SUMMARY:Thundercat - Hilltop Table of 4 Add-on (Does NOT Include GA)
DTSTAMP:20260818T032831Z
DTSTART:20261108T010000Z
DESCRIPTION:Perfect for groups of up to 4\, special access to an elevated v
	iewing area on the White Oak "Hilltop\," with some of the best views of th
	e stage. Area features seating for four\, a cocktail table\, cocktail serv
	ers\, and extra space for you and your friends! You only need to buy one t
	able for up to 4 people. The person who buys the table will be given 4 wri
	stbands for themselves and their guests. Tables are automatically assigned
	 as best available. THIS IS A TABLE VOUCHER FOR THE PURCHASE OF A TABLE. I
	T DOES NOT INCLUDE ADMISSION TO THE CONCERT. ADMISSION TICKETS TO THE CONC
	ERT MUST BE PURCHASED SEPARATELY. EACH PERSON AT THE TABLE MUST HAVE THEIR
	 OWN ADMISSION TICKET TO THE CONCERT. EXAMPLE: IF FOUR PEOPLE WILL BE AT T
	HE TABLE\, YOU WILL NEED TO PURCHASE: (1) THIS TABLE VOUCHER\, AND (2) 4 A
	DMISSION TICKETS\nPerfect for groups of up to 4\, special access to an ele
	vated viewing area on the White Oak "Hilltop\," with some of the best view
	s of the stage. Area features seating for four\, a cocktail table\, cockta
